-- The parity step of Kuhn's lemma: rooms are the simplices of the cube,
-- doors are their faces labelled 0, …, n − 1, and the handshake count
-- turns an odd number of doors on the boundary into an odd number of
-- completely labelled simplices
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
